tle">Google account</string><string name="privacy_account_body">If you sign in with Google, GlowCare receives only your name and email from Google Sign-In to remember your profile. We never see your password and never post anything on your behalf.</string><string name="privacy_billing_title">Subscriptions</string><string name="privacy_billing_body">Premium is a Google Play subscription. Billing, trials and cancellations are handled entirely by Google Play — GlowCare only checks whether your subscription is active. No card details ever reach the app.</string><string name="privacy_permissions_title">Permissions, when needed</string><string name="privacy_permissions_body">Camera: only when you open the beauty camera.\nMicrophone: only when you record video with sound.\nGallery access uses Android\'s private photo picker — you choose the exact photo, and no broad gallery permission is ever requested.</string><string name="channel_name">Daily self-care reminders</string><string name="channel_desc">Your daily beauty &amp; self-care tip reminder</string><string name="notif_1">✨ Today\'s tip is ready for you</string><string name="notif_2">2 minutes for yourself today? 💗</string><string name="notif_3">Your daily self-care moment is waiting ✨</string><string name="notif_4">Small habits. Better care. Every day 🌸</string><string name="cat_hair">Hair</string><string name="cat_skin">Face &amp; Skin</string><string name="cat_oral">Oral Care</string><string name="cat_body">Body Hygiene</string><string name="cat_nails">Hands &amp; Nails</string><string name="cat_feet">Feet</string><string name="cat_underarm">Underarm Care</string><string name="cat_grooming">Personal Grooming</string><string name="cat_menstrual">Menstrual Hygiene</string><string name="cat_sleep">Sleep &amp; Recovery</string><string name="cat_nutrition">Nutrition &amp; Hydration</string><string name="cat_fitness">Fitness &amp; Movement</string><string name="cat_selfcare">Self-Care</string><string name="cat_everyday">E